# The arena image needs bot/arena, the deck list reader and the tournament lists (the open tables), app,
# meta/atlas-kit.js, dashboard/site, the vendored viewer kit with its license list and spec/protocol.md (Dockerfile, for
# arena_guide); keep the rest out. bot/test/window-image.test.js checks every file the Dockerfile copies is let in.
*
!package.json
!bot/arena
!bot/decklists.js
!bot/decks/ash-meta-2026-09.json
!app
!meta/atlas-kit.js
!dashboard/site
!vendor/holotable/swu-viewer-kit.js
!vendor/holotable/swu-viewer-kit.licenses.txt
!spec/protocol.md
app/dist
